@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@skarbiec.local",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!123"
}

### Dashboard — the user's latest snapshot (byAccount rows carry percentage of net worth; accountId null = assets outside accounts; byGroup rows likewise, groupId null = assets in no group)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — range: 1M | 1Y | YTD | MAX (default 1Y), one point per snapshot date; response carries points plus changePln / changePercent (null without two points)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Target allocation — current value, share and deviation per group from the latest valuation (isConfigured false until a target is saved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/target-allocation
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Target allocation — save the whole target (AssetClass ints: 2 = Stock, 3 = Etf, 4 = Bond, 1 = Deposit, 6 = PreciousMetal); targets sum to 100, one decimal
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/target-allocation
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groups": [
    { "name": "Stocks and ETFs", "assetClasses": [2, 3], "targetPercent": 50, "bandPp": 5 },
    { "name": "Bonds", "assetClasses": [4, 1], "targetPercent": 40, "bandPp": 5 },
    { "name": "Metals", "assetClasses": [6], "targetPercent": 10, "bandPp": 5 }
  ]
}

### Group target allocation — compared with the value of that group's assets only (isConfigured false and groups [] until saved; groupId from /api/portfolio/asset-groups)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/target-allocation/groups/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Group target allocation — save the whole target of one group (same body and validation as the global one; publishes nothing)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/target-allocation/groups/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groups": [
    { "name": "Bonds", "assetClasses": [4, 1], "targetPercent": 60, "bandPp": 5 },
    { "name": "Stocks and ETFs", "assetClasses": [2, 3], "targetPercent": 30, "bandPp": 5 },
    { "name": "Metals", "assetClasses": [6], "targetPercent": 10, "bandPp": 3 }
  ]
}

### Group target allocation — delete (204, also when none is saved)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/target-allocation/groups/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — one asset class (AssetClass int: 3 = Etf), 0 on days the class was not held
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&assetClass=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — one asset group (groupId from /api/portfolio/asset-groups), by each asset's current group; add &assetClass= to narrow it
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&groupId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — assets in no group (ungrouped=true cannot be combined with groupId: 400 Validation.InvalidGroupFilter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&ungrouped=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
